{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g3-lite-25w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite 25W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out the Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite 25W Pod System, featuring an integrated 1200mAh battery, 25W maximum output, and delivering exceptional flavor from the compatible G3 Pods. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-g3-replacement-pods\" title=\"Uwell Caliburn G3 Pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn G3 Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"Shop Nicotine Salts\"\u003eShop Nicotine Salts\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from lightweight materials, the Caliburn G3 Lite offers exceptional portability while remaining reliable and sturdy. Encapsulating a 1200mAh battery, \u003cem\u003ethe Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite can operate for 3 days before needing a recharge, based on internal tests by Uwell's Lab\u003c\/em\u003e. Forgoing a screen or any buttons, Uwell has relegated the full battery capacity to outputting delicious flavor and vapor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/uwell\" title=\"Caliburn\"\u003eCaliburn Vape\u003c\/a\u003e G3 Lite 25W Pod System Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDIMENSIONS: 111.4mm by 28.8mm by 16.3mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CAPACITY: 1200mAh\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBATTERY CONFIGURATION: Integrated Rechargeable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWATTAGE RANGE: MAXIMUM WATTAGE: 25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHASSIS MATERIAL: Lightweight Materials\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOPERATION: Draw-Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOUTPUT: Continuous Voltage\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCHARGING: USB Type-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CONNECTION: Magnetic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD CAPACITY: 2.5mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePOD MATERIAL: PCTG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFILL SYSTEM: Side Fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCOIL SUPPORT: Integrated Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAIRFLOW: Pod Based (Rotate Pod to Switch)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Uwell Caliburn G3 Lite\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.6ohm Caliburn G3 Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41876307312695,"sku":"U Cali G3 Lite Pod System","price":3800.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell_caliburn_g3_lite_pod_system_-_space_black.webp?v=1757900573","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-caliburn-g3-lite-25w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




